#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/uart.md:10
msgid "UART formats, words and RS485 composition"
msgstr "UART 格式、数值字与 RS485 装配"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/uart.md:12
msgid ""
"Use these faces for byte or numeric-word transfers and the selected UART "
"wire format. RS485 composition owns its DE signal, setup and hold timing, "
"execution progress and joined shutdown."
msgstr ""
"使用这些接口传输字节或数值字，并采用所选 UART 线格式。RS485 装配拥有 DE 信号、建立与保持时间、执行推进及完成 join 的停机。"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/uart.md:16
msgid ""
"For RS485, prefer `nx_factory_uart_tx_binding_ref()` with one strongly typed"
" UART reference. Its `nx_uart_tx_binding_t` pairs the transport and exact-"
"context validator; unsupported modes and invalid IDs return two null fields."
" Lookup neither admits a transfer nor authenticates an instance. The caller "
"owns DE, setup/hold timing and joined shutdown; the {doc}`RS485 contract "
"</reference/contracts/io/uart-dma-rs485>` defines the composition. IRQ "
"timestamps and sampled GPIO levels remain observations, with the source "
"quality defined by the selected provider and the [infrared "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/infrared/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"RS485 优先通过同一个强类型 UART 引用调用 `nx_factory_uart_tx_binding_ref()`。返回的 "
"`nx_uart_tx_binding_t` 配对 transport 与精确上下文 validator；不支持的模式和非法 ID 返回两个 NULL "
"字段。查询不准入传输，也不认证实例。调用者拥有 DE、建立／保持时间与联合关闭；{doc}`RS485 合同 "
"</reference/contracts/io/uart-dma-rs485>`定义组合方式。IRQ 时间戳和采样 GPIO "
"电平仍是观测，其来源质量由所选 provider 与[红外合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/devices/infrared/README.md)定义。"

